If one does not exist, create a clean centralized theme.

Use approximately the following design tokens:

PALETTE

primary.main: #1F5EA8
primary.dark: #173F73

background.default: #F6F8FB
background.paper: #FFFFFF

text.primary: #172033
text.secondary: #667085

divider: #E4E7EC

success.main: #16865C
error.main: #C9363E
