==================================================
TYPOGRAPHY
==================================================

Use:

font-family:
Inter, Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif

If Inter is not already available, DO NOT introduce an unnecessary external dependency just for the font.
Use the best existing/system font fallback.

Establish a clear hierarchy:

Page title:
- approximately 26-28px
- font weight 650-700
- text.primary

Section heading:
- approximately 18px
- font weight 600

Card heading:
- approximately 14-16px
- font weight 600

Body:
- approximately 14px
- comfortable line height

Secondary/helper text:
- approximately 12-13px
- text.secondary

Metric values:
- approximately 28-32px
- font weight 700

Avoid excessive font-weight variation.

==================================================
SPACING
==================================================

Use an 8px-based spacing system consistently.

Examples:

4px  = very small internal separation
8px  = compact spacing
16px = standard component spacing
24px = card/page section spacing
32px = major section spacing

Remove arbitrary spacing values where practical.

The page should feel spacious without wasting screen real estate.

==================================================
SHAPE
==================================================

Use approximately:

borderRadius: 10px

Cards and surfaces should generally have:

- white background
- subtle 1px divider-colored border
- little or no shadow

Avoid floating-card appearance.

Use hierarchy through spacing, typography, borders, and background rather than heavy shadows.

